WEBVTT

00:00:01.330 --> 00:00:04.133
A plotting house style, audited against its own figures.

00:00:04.133 --> 00:00:07.870
The rule that would have mattered most is not in the list.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:14.685
ImmunoStruct against Prime-2.1, AUROC, y-axis floor at 0.5.

00:00:14.685 --> 00:00:19.834
True ratio, 1.64×; drawn bar ratio, 10.05×.

00:00:19.834 --> 00:00:25.718
The drawn bars are 0.382 and 0.038 tall.

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:31.303
Green-for-better against red-for-worse, colour difference in ΔE00.

00:00:31.303 --> 00:00:35.163
Normal vision, 45.5; deuteranope simulation, 5.2.

00:00:35.163 --> 00:00:40.310
Accessibility is not mentioned anywhere in the repo.

00:00:41.300 --> 00:00:47.191
API functions the SKILL.md specifies; no file in the repo implements them: 9.

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:51.233
The one rule they left out beats the thirteen they wrote down.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:58.858
